        "original_id": "7979c845-de82-56c1-bcc6-b9091cbd83c9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter Asher, Esperanza Spalding, Sara Watkins, Waddy Wachtel, Carmen Cusack\n- Products: Love Has Come for You, Bright Star, Wicked\n- Roles: record producer, guitarist, singer, manager, Alice Murphy, Elphaba\n- Topics: Grammy-winning collaboration, Broadway musicals\n\nFacts:\n- Peter Asher was born on 22 June 1944 and is a British guitarist, singer, manager, and record producer.\n- Peter Asher produced the album Love Has Come for You.\n- The album Love Has Come for You features musical appearances by Esperanza Spalding, Sara Watkins, Waddy Wachtel, and others.\n- In 2013, Love Has Come for You was a bluegrass album and a Grammy-winning collaboration that inspired the musical Bright Star.\n- Carmen Cusack originated the role of Alice Murphy in the Broadway musical Bright Star.\n- Carmen Cusack is also known for playing Elphaba in the Chicago, North American Tour, and Melbourne productions of Wicked.",
